~ start
Az: Kid? What're you doing here! I told you stay back!
Fenn: But... adventure...
Az: Ugh. It's fine. You're here now. And we're stuck, by the way
Az: There's a big chunk of ice blocking the path, thanks to that Wizard.
Fenn: Oh but you can melt it though! Fire breath time!
Az: Uh... mm... n-no.
Az: One look at this, it's too big for my fire. It'll melt, but we'd be here for days.
Fenn: I've got days.
Az: Yeah, and I don't. I need to get into my workshop. If we're splitting up, take one of my bangles.
Az: I made it a while back. Use it, and I should be able to help you.
Fenn: Should?
Az: Well... I've never really... tried before.
Az: Wait- what's your name, kid?
Fenn: I'm Fenn.
Az: Alright, well, good to meet you, I guess.
=> END